.el .ds Aq '
.TH paynal 1  "paynal 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
paynal \- CLI\-first API client, routine runner, and AI agent integration engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpaynal\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
CLI\-first API client, routine runner, and AI agent integration engine
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
paynal\-init(1)
Initialize a new Paynal workspace in the current directory
.TP
paynal\-add(1)
Add a new request or routine YAML template
.TP
paynal\-exec(1)
Execute a request, routine, or an entire collection folder
.TP
paynal\-remove(1)
Remove a request or routine from the workspace index
.TP
paynal\-clean(1)
Clean unindexed orphan files or output directory
.TP
paynal\-doc(1)
Generate Markdown documentation for a request or routine
.TP
paynal\-export(1)
Export requests or collections to standard formats (curl, insomnia, postman)
.TP
paynal\-mcp(1)
Start Model Context Protocol (MCP) server mode for AI Agents
.TP
paynal\-import(1)
Import requests from external formats (Postman v2.1, Insomnia v4)
.TP
paynal\-ui(1)
Launch interactive Terminal User Interface (TUI) dashboard
.TP
paynal\-man(1)
View or generate UNIX man page documentation
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
